# Pass 3: the mod set that mounts the three optional mods the compatibility patches name. Select it with
# `-DepMap wsl-deps.avec-facultatifs.map`; the report carries the pass name `avec-facultatifs`.
#
# The three mods do not exclude each other: they touch different fields (recipe lists, a body clock, crossbreeding),
# so one pass covers all three. Each needs only Harmony as a hard dependency, which every pass already stages.
#
# THE ORDER IS NOT A DETAIL. The staging loads the mods of a map BEFORE the mod under test, and A Dog Said... Animal
# Prosthetics 2 has to load AFTER it: this mod declares <loadBefore> for it, because ADS 2 copies its category lists
# once, at its own last patch. A mod of the map that must load after the mod under test obliges the map to NAME the
# mod under test, before it (the staging does not add it twice). So this mod comes first, then ADS 2. The other two
# read what is loaded at run time and need no order.
nelim.pickletools.loadaudit             path:PickleTools/LoadAudit/Mod
nelim.funnycreatures                    path:FunnyCreaturesRenew/Mod
